Good morning ☀️ 

As an airdrop farmer, what I look for in AI agents is simple: less repetitive work and more time saved.

@ax1vc’s newly launched Autopilot runs quests on its own. Being able to delegate that work to an agent instead of completing each quest manually is a https://t.co/ygkJCCMimO

Virtuals and Venice helped to establish Base as a home for AI infrastructure.

I believe the next step is infrastructure for agents that do more than generate responses. they need to work across apps, with actions that can be tested and trusted.

@ax1vc is building towards both https://t.co/OskdeIJv1v

